# =======================================================
# Main Plot
# =======================================================

PLOT MainPlot.

    PHASE phase_0 INITIAL.
    PHASE phase_1.
    PHASE subplot_phase.

    ROLE Role0.
    ROLE Role1.

    DURING PLOT:
        WHEN evt_0:
            END PLOT.

